• G2.4 → G2.4.1, G2.4.2 [Fallback]:  
  Justification: The door may be opened either unassisted by the robot (G2.4.1) or with human cooperation (G2.4.2).

• G2 → G2.1, G2.2, G2.3 [Fallback]:  
  Justification: Dish retrieval can occur unassisted (G2.1), with two robots cooperating (G2.2), or with human assistance (G2.3).

